{"id":"n64685-3-10","stage":2,"title":"맡기다 · 委托","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64685-3-10-1","ko":"아까 맡기신 가방이 이 가방인가요?","zh":"刚才您托付的包是这个包吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚，刚才","explanation":"아까：刚，刚才。","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65975","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}},{"text":"맡기신","meaning":"委托，托付，寄托","explanation":"맡기다：委托，托付，寄托；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"맡기다","audio":"/audio/e2fc4d9a742ac29aee5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64685","senseId":"3","lemma":"맡기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맡기신","audio":"/audio/79992f7df250d524eea2.mp3"}},{"text":"가방이","meaning":"包，背包，提包","explanation":"가방：包，背包，提包；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가방","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18259","senseId":"1","lemma":"가방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가방이","audio":"/audio/3bacd65ffcbf66c44b88.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"가방인가요?","meaning":"包，背包，提包","explanation":"가방：包，背包，提包；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ가요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"가방","audio":"/audio/6852b2954fc8556674f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18259","senseId":"1","lemma":"가방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가방인가요","audio":"/audio/4aaf00fd6ac6e4b514d7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚，刚才","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65975","definition":"前不久。","pronunciation":["아까"]},